      <div type="sermon">
        <head style="text-align: center; font-variant: smallcaps">
          in caput ieiunii.
          Þis spel gebyrað seofon niht ær lenctene.
        </head>
      <ab>
        <lb n="1" />
         ON ĐYSSE WUCAN ON WODNES-DÆG SWA SWA GE SYLFE 
        <lb n="2" />
        is caput ieiunii . 
        <choice>
            <orig>ƀ</orig>
            <expan>þæt</expan>
        </choice>
          is on englisc . heafod lenctenes fæste
        <lb n="3" />
        nes . We etað on þam sunnan dagü on undern 
        <choice>
                    <orig>⁊on</orig>
            <expan>and on</expan>
        </choice>
        æfen .
    <pb n="64r" facs="135-64r" />
        <lb n="4" />
         forðan þe se sunnan dæg is swa halig 
        <choice>
            <orig>ƀ</orig>
            <expan>þæt</expan>
        </choice> 
         se man bið wyrðe 
        <lb n="5" />
        ðe on þam dæge fæstan wile. 
        <choice>
            <orig>ƀ</orig>
            <expan>þæt</expan>
        </choice> 
        he beo amansumod gif he
        <lb n="6" />
         hit for his anwlysnysse deð . Ne eac man ne mót . cneo
        <lb n="7" />
         wian on sunnan dagum . We sculon swa þeah ægðer ge on
        <lb n="8" />
         sunnon dagum ge on oðrum dagum druncennysse 
         <choice>
            <orig>⁊ofer</orig>
            <expan>and ofer</expan>
         </choice>
        <lb n="9" />
        fylle forbugan . þe ðam þe us bec tæcað . 
        <choice>
            <orig>⁊huru</orig>
            <expan>and huru</expan>
        </choice> 
        swyðost 
        <lb n="10" />
        on lencten . Nu þe beoð þa feowertig daga on urü lencten
        <lb n="11" />
        licü fæstene gefyllede . buton we fæsten þær foran to þas 
        <lb n="12" />
        feower dagas . wodnes dæg . 
        <choice>
            <orig>⁊þunres</orig>
            <expan>and þunres</expan>
        </choice> 
        dæg . 
        <choice>
            <orig>⁊frige</orig>
         <expan>and frige</expan>
         </choice>
        dæg . 
        <choice>
            <orig>⁊sæt</orig>
            <expan>and sæt</expan>
        </choice>
            dæg . 
        <lb n="13" />
         ernes dæg . swa swa hit gefyrn geset wæs þeah ðe we hit
        <lb n="14" />
        eow nu secgan . On þone wodnes dæg wide geond eorðan . 
        <lb n="15" />
        cerdas bletsiað swa swa hit geset is . clæne axan on cyrcan .
        <lb n="16" />
        <choice>
         <orig>⁊þa</orig> 
            <expan>and þa</expan>
            </choice>
          siððan lecgað uppa manna heafda .  
        <choice>
            <orig>ƀ</orig>
            <expan>þæt</expan>
        </choice> 
        hi habban
        <lb n="17" />
        on gemynde 
        <choice>
            <orig>ƀ</orig>
            <expan>þæt</expan>
        </choice>  
        hi of eorðan comon . 
        <choice>
            <orig>⁊eft</orig>
            <expan>and eft</expan>
        </choice>      
        to duste gewen
        <lb n="18" />
        dad . swa swa se ælmihtiga god to adame cwæð . siððan he
        <lb n="19" />
        agylt hæfde ongean godes bebod . On geswincü þu leofast
        <lb n="20" />
        <choice>
            <orig>⁊on</orig>
            <expan>and on</expan>
        </choice>   
        swate þu etst þinne hláf on eorðan . oð  
        <choice>
            <orig>ƀ</orig>
            <expan>þæt</expan>
        </choice> 
        þu eft gewen
        <lb n="21" />
        de to þære ylcan eorðan þe þu of come . forðan þe þu
        <lb n="22" />
        eart dust . 
        <choice>
            <orig>⁊to</orig>
            <expan>and to</expan>
        </choice>
        duste gewendst . Nis þis na gesæd be man
        <lb n="23" />
        sawlum . ac be manna lichaman þe for-molsniað to
        <lb n="24" />
        duste . 
        <choice>
            <orig>⁊eft</orig>
            <expan>and eft</expan>
        </choice> 
        sceolan on domes dæg ðurh ures drihtnes
        <lb n="25" />
        mihte ealle of eorðan arísan þe æfre cuce wæron .  
        <lb n="26" />
        swa swa ealle treowa cuciað æfre on lenctenes timan .
        <lb n="27" />
        þe ær þurh wyntræs cyle wurdon adydde . We rædað on
        <lb n="28" />
        bocum ægðer ge on ðære ealdan á . ge on þære níwan .
        <lb n="29" />
        <choice>
            <orig>ƀ</orig>
            <expan>þæt</expan>
        </choice> 
        þa menn þe heora synna be-hreowsodon .  
        <choice>
            <orig>ƀ</orig>
            <expan>þæt</expan>
        </choice> 
        hí mid ax
        <lb n="30" />
        um hi sylfe bestreowodon . 
        <choice>
            <orig>⁊mid</orig>
            <expan>and mid</expan>
        </choice> 
        hæran hi gescryddon
        <lb n="31" />
         to lice . nu do we þis lytle on ures lenctenes anginne .
        <lb n="32" />
        <choice>
            <orig>ƀ</orig>
            <expan>þæt</expan>
        </choice> 
         we streowiað axan uppan ure heafda to geswutelun
        <lb n="33" />
        ge  
        <choice>
            <orig>ƀ</orig>
            <expan>þæt</expan>
        </choice> 
        we sculon ure synna behreowsian . on ure lenc
        <lb n="34" />
        ten licum fæstene . Sum unge rad mann wæs mid
        <lb n="35" />
        ælfstane bisceope on wiltun-scire on hirede . se man
    <pb n="64v" facs="136-64v" />
        <lb n="36" />
        nolde gan to þám axum on þone wodnes dæg swa swa oðre
         <lb n="37" /> 
        men dydon þe þa mæssan ge sohton . Þa bædon his ge
        <lb n="38" />
        feran
        <choice>
            <orig>ƀ</orig>
            <expan>þæt</expan>
        </choice>  
        he eode to þam mæsse preoste . 
        <choice>
            <orig>⁊under</orig>
            <expan>and under</expan>
        </choice> 
        fæn
        <lb n="39" />
        ge þa gerynu þe hi under fengon . He cwæð icnelle .
        <lb n="40" />
        Hi bædon þa-git . he cwæð  
        <choice>
            <orig>ƀ</orig>
            <expan>þæt</expan>
        </choice> 
        he nolde . 
        <choice>
            <orig>⁊wealode</orig>
            <expan>and wealode</expan>
        </choice> 
        midwordü .
        <lb n="41" /> 
    <choice>
        <orig>⁊sæde</orig>
        <expan>and sæde</expan>
    </choice>  
    <choice>
        <orig>ƀ</orig>
            <expan>þæt</expan>
        </choice>  
    he wolde his wifes brucan on þam unalyfedü
    <lb n="42" /> 
    timan . Hi leton þa swa . 
    <choice>
        <orig>⁊hit</orig>
        <expan>and hit</expan>
    </choice>
     gelamp  
     <choice>
        <orig>ƀ</orig>
        <expan>þæt</expan>
    </choice>
    se gedwola rad
    <lb n="43" />
    on ðære wucan ymbe sum ærende . þa gestodon hine
    <lb n="44" />
    hundas hetelice swyðe . 
    <choice>
        <orig>⁊he</orig>
        <expan>and he</expan>
    </choice>
     hine werode oþ  ƀ (þæt) his sceaft
    <lb n="45" />
    ætstod ætforan him . 
    <choice>
        <orig>⁊</orig>
        <expan>and</expan>
    </choice> 
    <choice>
        <orig>ƀ</orig>
        <expan>þæt</expan>
    </choice>
    hors hine bær forð . swa  
  <choice>
        <orig>ƀ</orig>
        <expan>þæt</expan>
    </choice>  
    <choice>
        <orig>ƀ</orig>
        <expan>þæt</expan>
    </choice>
    <lb n="46" />
    spere him eode þurh ut . 
    <choice>
        <orig>⁊he</orig>
        <expan>and he</expan>
    </choice>
     feoll cwelende . He wearð
    <lb n="47" />
    ða bebyrged . 
    <choice>
        <orig>⁊him</orig>
        <expan>and him</expan>
    </choice>
     læg on uppan fela byrðena eorðan
    <lb n="48" />
    binnon seofon nihton . þæs ðe hé forsóc þa feawa axan .
    <lb n="49" />
    On þære ylcan wucan com sum truð to þæs bisceopes hi
    <lb n="50" />
    rede . se ne gymde nanes lenctenes fæstenes . ac eode him
    <lb n="51" />
    to kicenan . þa hwíle ðe se bisceop mæssode 
    <choice>
        <orig>⁊began</orig>
        <expan>and began</expan>
    </choice>
    to
    <lb n="52" />
    etenne . þe feoll þa æt ðære forman snæde under-becc
    <lb n="53" />
    geswogen . 
    <choice>
        <orig>⁊spaw</orig>
        <expan>and spaw</expan>
    </choice>
     blod . ac him gebyrede swa ðeah  
     <choice>
        <orig>ƀ</orig>
        <expan>þæt</expan>
    </choice>
    feorh
    <lb n="54" />
    earfoðlice . Us sæde eac oft Æþelwold se halga bisceop
    <lb n="55" />
    þe nu wyrcð wundra þurh god .  
     <choice>
        <orig>ƀ</orig>
        <expan>þæt</expan>
    </choice> 
    he cuðe anne mann mid
    <lb n="56" />
    ælfege bisceope . se wolde drincan on lenctene <sup>n</sup>nex .
    <choice>
       <orig>þo<hi rend="superscript">n</hi>ne</orig>
        <expan>þonne</expan>
    </choice>
    <lb n="57" />
     hine lyste . þa sume dæg bæd he þone bisceop ælfeh .
    <lb n="58" />
    blætsian his ful . he nolde . 
    <choice>
        <orig>⁊se</orig>
        <expan>and se</expan>
    </choice>
    dysiga dranc butan
    <lb n="59" />
    bletsunge 
    <choice>
        <orig>⁊eode</orig>
