    </choice>
     him út . Man slætte þa ænne fearr
    <lb n="60" />
    feringa þær-ute . 
    <choice>
        <orig>⁊se </orig>
        <expan>and se</expan>
    </choice>
    fear arn him togeanes . 
    <choice>    
